Show and edit Knapsack's settings, kept in config.toml: profiles (managed with
knapsack profiles), how each source is read and its API keys (knapsack
sources), and settings for all of Knapsack.

Usage:
  knapsack config [flags]
  knapsack config [command]

Available Commands:
  edit        Edit config.toml in your editor
  view        Print the config, with API keys redacted

Flags:
  -h, --help   help for config

Global Flags:
      --config string   use this config file instead of the default
  -v, --verbose         show progress and the underlying cause of errors

Use "knapsack config [command] --help" for more information about a command.
